-     - $sum\_amp = 0.0$
-   - Iterate octaves $o$ from $0$ to $n\_octaves - 1$:
-     - Calculate local amplitude: $amp\_local = (1.0 / (o + 1)) \cdot \text{amp}$ [S2, unofficial].
